8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#222'><div style='font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px'>What these product specs mean</div><div style='margin-bottom:10px;color:#555;font-size:14px'>Please read these before you choose. On the next screen you will compare the products and make one choice; a short reminder of these definitions stays available there.</div><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px'><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Pressure (bar):</b> the force pushing water through the coffee. About 9 to 15 bar is the standard for true espresso (the thin golden crema on top); higher means stronger extraction.</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Manual / lever:</b> operated by hand with no electricity; you control the shot yourself.</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Weight:</b> how heavy it is to carry; lower is more portable (16 oz = 1 lb).</li></ul></div>"}, {"Description": "glossary_compact", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "glossary_compact", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<details class='sb-gloss' style='max-width:760px;margin:12px auto 0;padding:8px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#333'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#444'>What these terms mean (reminder)</summary><ul style='margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px'><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Pressure (bar):</b> the force pushing water through the coffee. About 9 to 15 bar is the standard for true espresso (the thin golden crema on top); higher means stronger extraction.</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Manual / lever:</b> operated by hand with no electricity; you control the shot yourself.</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Weight:</b> how heavy it is to carry; lower is more portable (16 oz = 1 lb).</li></ul></details>"}, {"Description": "choice_cards", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_cards", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "[{\"brand\": \"Stanley\", \"model\": \"French Press\", \"code\": \"p4\", \"fails\": [\"true espresso pressure (15 bar or more)\", \"a weight under one pound\"]}, {\"brand\": \"Keurig\", \"model\": \"K-Mini Plus\", \"code\": \"p0\", \"fails\": [\"true espresso pressure (15 bar or more)\", \"a weight under one pound\", \"no electricity needed (manual operation)\"]}, {\"brand\": \"Portabrew\", \"model\": \"Picopresso\", \"code\": \"p2\", \"fails\": []}, {\"brand\": \"Nespresso\", \"model\": \"Pixie\", \"code\": \"p3\", \"fails\": [\"true espresso pressure (15 bar or more)\", \"a weight under one pound\", \"no electricity needed (manual operation)\"]}, {\"brand\": \"AeroPress\", \"model\": \"Go\", \"code\": \"p1\", \"fails\": [\"true espresso pressure (15 bar or more)\"]}]"}, {"Description": "choice_stem", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_stem", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Which one would you choose for yourself? Choose one."}, {"Description": "shown_dominant_pos", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_dominant_pos", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "3"}, {"Description": "shown_focal_pos", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_focal_pos", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "2"}, {"Description": "shown_order", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_order", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "4,0,2,3,1"}, {"Description": "attr1_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr1_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Type"}, {"Description": "attr2_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr2_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Brew temperature"}, {"Description": "attr3_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr3_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Weight"}, {"Description": "why_verb", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "why_verb", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "choose"}, {"Description": "category_intro", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "category_intro", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<div style='max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#222'><p>In this task, you are making a shopping decision for yourself. You are shopping for:</p><h2 style='margin:.4em 0'>coffee makers</h2><p>On the next page you will see what you are looking for and the set of options you are considering, and you will choose one option. The product details shown are representative of real products; please do not look anything up.</p></div>"}, {"Description": "comp_q", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_q", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<span style='font-size:16px'><b>According to the guide, which of these can brew true espresso (with the golden crema on top)?</b></span>"}, {"Description": "comp_opt1", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt1", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "A machine with about 1 to 2 bar of pressure"}, {"Description": "comp_opt2", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt2", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "A machine with about 9 to 15 bar of pressure"}, {"Description": "comp_opt3", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt3", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Pressure has nothing to do with espresso"}, {"Description": "comp_correct", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_correct", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "2"}]}, {"Type": "EmbeddedData", "FlowID": "FL_22", "EmbeddedData": [{"Description": "assigned_level", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_level", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "baseline"}, {"Description": "assigned_frame", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_frame", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "advise_other"}, {"Description": "assortment_id", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assortment_id", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "sr_headphones_03"}, {"Description": "category", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "category", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "over-ear headphones"}, {"Description": "dominant_brand", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "dominant_brand", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Arcwave"}, {"Description": "focal_brand", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "focal_brand", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Sony"}, {"Description": "level_prompt", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "level_prompt", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "A friend has asked you for advice. They are shopping for a pair of over-ear headphones and are torn between the options shown below. Here is what they told you, in their own words:\n\n\"I'm looking for a pair of over-ear headphones. I care about planar magnetic drivers, an open-back design, and impedance under 40 ohm. Which of these should I get?\""}, {"Description": "table_html", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "table_html", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<style>.sb-table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a1a}.sb-table th,.sb-table td{border:1px solid #cfd6dd;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.sb-table thead th{background:#f4f6f8}.sb-prod{font-weight:700}.sb-model{font-weight:400;color:#566;font-size:12px}.sb-row{background:#fafbfc;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}.sb-parity td{color:#444}</style><table class='sb-table'><thead><tr><th></th><th class='sb-prod'>Bose<div class='sb-model'>700</div></th><th class='sb-prod'>Arcwave<div class='sb-model'>Sundara</div></th><th class='sb-prod'>Beyerdynamic<div class='sb-model'>DT 900 Pro X</div></th><th class='sb-prod'>Audio-Technica<div class='sb-model'>ATH-M50xBT2</div></th><th class='sb-prod'>Sony<div class='sb-model'>WH-1000XM4</div></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class='sb-row'>Price</th><td>$329.00</td><td>$189.00</td><td>$269.00</td><td>$199.00</td><td>$248.00</td></tr><tr><th class='sb-row'>Design</th><td>over-ear</td><td>over-ear open-back</td><td>over-ear open-back</td><td>over-ear</td><td>over-ear</td></tr><tr><th class='sb-row'>Battery life</th><td>20 hours</td><td>wired only</td><td>wired only</td><td>50 hours</td><td>30 hours</td></tr><tr><th class='sb-row'>Driver</th><td>40mm</td><td>planar magnetic 80mm</td><td>45mm STELLAR.45</td><td>45mm</td><td>40mm</td></tr><tr><th class='sb-row'>Audio codec</th><td>AAC/SBC</td><td>N/A (wired)</td><td>N/A (wired)</td><td>LDAC/AAC</td><td>LDAC/aptX</td></tr><tr><th class='sb-row'>Impedance</th><td>22 ohm</td><td>37 ohm</td><td>48 ohm</td><td>38 ohm</td><td>47 ohm</td></tr><tr class='sb-parity'><th class='sb-row'>Customer rating</th><td>4.3 / 5 average customer rating</td><td>4.3 / 5 average customer rating</td><td>4.3 / 5 average customer rating</td><td>4.3 / 5 average customer rating</td><td>4.3 / 5 average customer rating</td></tr><tr class='sb-parity'><th class='sb-row'>Number of reviews</th><td>500 verified reviews</td><td>500 verified reviews</td><td>500 verified reviews</td><td>500 verified reviews</td><td>500 verified reviews</td></tr></tbody></table>"}, {"Description": "glossary_full", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "glossary_full", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<div style='max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 20px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#222'><div style='font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:8px'>What these product specs mean</div><div style='margin-bottom:10px;color:#555;font-size:14px'>Please read these before you choose. On the next screen you will compare the products and make one choice; a short reminder of these definitions stays available there.</div><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px'><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></div>"}, {"Description": "glossary_compact", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "glossary_compact", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<details class='sb-gloss' style='max-width:760px;margin:12px auto 0;padding:8px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#333'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#444'>What these terms mean (reminder)</summary><ul style='margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px'><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></details>"}, {"Description": "choice_cards", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_cards", "VariableT