 "Field": "why_verb", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "recommend"}, {"Description": "category_intro", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "category_intro", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<div style='max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#222'><p>In this task, a friend has asked you to help with a shopping decision. They are shopping for:</p><h2 style='margin:.4em 0'>over-ear headphones</h2><p>On the next page you will see what your friend told you they are looking for and the set of options they are considering, and you will recommend one option to them. The product details shown are representative of real products; please do not look anything up.</p></div>"}, {"Description": "comp_q", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_q", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<span style='font-size:16px'><b>According to the guide, which headphones are easier to power straight from a phone, without a separate amplifier?</b></span>"}, {"Description": "comp_opt1", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt1", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Lower-impedance headphones (fewer ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt2", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt2", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Higher-impedance headphones (more ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt3", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt3", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Impedance makes no difference to this"}, {"Description": "comp_correct", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_correct", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "1"}]}, {"Type": "EmbeddedData", "FlowID": "FL_23", "EmbeddedData": [{"Description": "assigned_level", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_level", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisi