rgin-bottom:10px;color:#555;font-size:14px'>Please read these before you choose. On the next screen you will compare the products and make one choice; a short reminder of these definitions stays available there.</div><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px'><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></div>"}, {"Description": "glossary_compact", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "glossary_compact", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<details class='sb-gloss' style='max-width:760px;margin:12px auto 0;padding:8px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#333'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#444'>What these terms mean (reminder)</summary><ul style='margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px'><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></details>"}, {"Description": "choice_cards", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_cards", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "[{\"brand\": \"Arcwave\", \"model\": \"Sundara\", \"code\": \"p2\", \"