 "Type": "Custom", "Field": "category_intro", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<div style='max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#222'><p>In this task, you are making a shopping decision for yourself. You are shopping for:</p><h2 style='margin:.4em 0'>over-ear headphones</h2><p>On the next page you will see what you are looking for and the set of options you are considering, and you will choose one option. The product details shown are representative of real products; please do not look anything up.</p></div>"}, {"Description": "comp_q", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_q", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<span style='font-size:16px'><b>According to the guide, which headphones are easier to power straight from a phone, without a separate amplifier?</b></span>"}, {"Description": "comp_opt1", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt1", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Lower-impedance headphones (fewer ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt2", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt2", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Higher-impedance headphones (more ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt3", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt3", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Impedance makes no difference to this"}, {"Description": "comp_correct", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_correct", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "1"}]}, {"Type": "EmbeddedData", "FlowID": "FL_24", "EmbeddedData": [{"Description": "assigned_level", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_level", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "weighted"}, {"Description": "assigned_frame", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_frame", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "Analyz