margin-bottom:8px'>What these product specs mean</div><div style='margin-bottom:10px;color:#555;font-size:14px'>Please read these before you choose. On the next screen you will compare the products and make one choice; a short reminder of these definitions stays available there.</div><ul style='margin:0;padding-left:20px'><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.5em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></div>"}, {"Description": "glossary_compact", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "glossary_compact", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<details class='sb-gloss' style='max-width:760px;margin:12px auto 0;padding:8px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #e1e4e8;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#333'><summary style='cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#444'>What these terms mean (reminder)</summary><ul style='margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px'><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Planar magnetic drivers:</b> a higher-fidelity speaker type, generally more detailed than the dynamic drivers used in most headphones.</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Open-back design:</b> a wider, more natural sound, but it lets sound leak in and out (meant for quiet rooms).</li><li style='margin:.3em 0'><b>Impedance (ohms):</b> how much power the headphones need; <b>lower</b> ohms are easier to drive straight from a phone without a separate amplifier.</li></ul></details>"}, {"Description": "choice_cards", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_cards", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "[{\"brand\": \"Sony\", \"model\": \"WH-1000XM4\", \"code\": \"p0\", \"fails\": [\"planar magnetic drivers\", \"an open-back design\", \"impedance under 40 ohm\"]}, {\"brand\": \"Bose\", \"model\": \"700\", \"code\": \"p4\", \"fails\": [\"planar magnetic drivers\", \"an open-back design\"]}, {\"brand\": \"Arcwave\", \"model\": \"Sundara\", \"code\": \"p2\", \"fails\": []}, {\"brand\": \"Beyerdynamic\", \"model\": \"DT 900 Pro X\", \"code\": \"p3\", \"fails\": [\"planar magnetic drivers\", \"impedance under 40 ohm\"]}, {\"brand\": \"Audio-Technica\", \"model\": \"ATH-M50xBT2\", \"code\": \"p1\", \"fails\": [\"planar magnetic drivers\", \"an open-back design\"]}]"}, {"Description": "choice_stem", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "choice_stem", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Which one would you choose for yourself? Choose one."}, {"Description": "shown_dominant_pos", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_dominant_pos", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "3"}, {"Description": "shown_focal_pos", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_focal_pos", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "1"}, {"Description": "shown_order", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "shown_order", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "0,4,2,3,1"}, {"Description": "attr1_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr1_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Design"}, {"Description": "attr2_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr2_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Battery life"}, {"Description": "attr3_label", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "attr3_label", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Driver"}, {"Description": "why_verb", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "why_verb", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "choose"}, {"Description": "category_intro", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "category_intro", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<div style='max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#222'><p>In this task, you are making a shopping decision for yourself. You are shopping for:</p><h2 style='margin:.4em 0'>over-ear headphones</h2><p>On the next page you will see what you are looking for and the set of options you are considering, and you will choose one option. The product details shown are representative of real products; please do not look anything up.</p></div>"}, {"Description": "comp_q", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_q", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "<span style='font-size:16px'><b>According to the guide, which headphones are easier to power straight from a phone, without a separate amplifier?</b></span>"}, {"Description": "comp_opt1", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt1", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Lower-impedance headphones (fewer ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt2", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt2", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Higher-impedance headphones (more ohms)"}, {"Description": "comp_opt3", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_opt3", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Impedance makes no difference to this"}, {"Description": "comp_correct", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "comp_correct", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "1"}]}, {"Type": "EmbeddedData", "FlowID": "FL_28", "EmbeddedData": [{"Description": "assigned_level", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assigned_level", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "baseline"}, {"Description": "assigned_frame", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "assi