ase describe anything that did not work.</span>", "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<span style='font-size:16px'>Did anything seem broken or not work properly (for example the buttons, the product table, images, page loading, or the Next button)? Please describe anything that did not work.</span>", "DataExportTag": "feedback_technical", "QuestionType": "TE", "Selector": "ML", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "QuestionDescription": "Feedback: technical", "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "OFF", "ForceResponseType": "OFF", "Type": "None"}}, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "DataVisibility": {"Private": false, "Hidden": false}, "DefaultChoices": false, "SearchSource": {"AllowFreeResponse": "false"}, "NextChoiceId": 4, "NextAnswerId": 1, "QuestionID": "QID26"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_R6SKIcegNVUE53B", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID27", "SecondaryAttribute": "Feedback: realism", "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<span style='font-size:16px'>Did the products, brands, and prices seem realistic and believable to you? Why or why not?</span>", "QuestionText_Unsafe": "<span style='font-size:16px'>Did the products, brands, and prices seem realistic and believable to you? Why or why not?</span>", "DataExportTag": "feedback_realism", "QuestionType": "TE", "Selector": "ML", "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "QuestionDescription": "Feedback: realism", "Validation": {"Settings": {"ForceResponse": "OFF", "ForceResponseType": "OFF", "Type": "None"}}, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "DataVisibility": {"Private": false, "Hidden": false}, "DefaultChoices": false, "SearchSource": {"AllowFreeResponse": "false"}, "NextChoiceId": 4, "NextAnswerId": 1, "QuestionID": "QID27"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_R6SKIcegNVUE53B", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID28", "SecondaryAttribute": "Feedback: improve", "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"QuestionText": "<span style='font-size:16px'>Finally, is there anything 